1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:05,404
One full lap of Gift No.188.

2
00:00:05,804 --> 00:00:09,435
One road, start to start, a figure eight.

3
00:00:09,835 --> 00:00:15,819
Two clicks in: coins, heart, stations, fragments.

4
00:00:16,219 --> 00:00:19,314
Then the camera settles behind his shoulders.

5
00:00:19,714 --> 00:00:25,551
Here, the road doubles back. Nothing marks it but the road itself.

6
00:00:25,951 --> 00:00:28,036
He keeps the way home for everyone.

7
00:00:28,436 --> 00:00:30,863
The price is that no one remembers him.

8
00:00:31,263 --> 00:00:35,084
Space, and the station asks you to remember a bird.

9
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:42,488
You take a shard for it. One of five.

10
00:00:43,800 --> 00:00:46,722
Two more visits there before it gives anything up.

11
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:53,581
And you are allowed to be late. That is the rule of the place.

12
00:00:53,981 --> 00:00:59,173
Nothing here can kill you. Composure only falls and never locks:

13
00:00:59,573 --> 00:01:04,162
no enemy, no fail state, no timer you can lose.

14
00:01:05,500 --> 00:01:10,316
The road keeps changing its mind. Pines, then bamboo,

15
00:01:11,500 --> 00:01:17,008
then open ground, a pavilion on the rise, and towers far off.

16
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:23,936
Paper, ink, a seal and an envelope wait at the bottom of the screen.

17
00:01:24,336 --> 00:01:27,638
All of it gets pressed into one postcard at the end.

18
00:01:29,500 --> 00:01:32,395
Every building on this route is built in code,

19
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:38,247
and the road itself downloads no texture files at all.

20
00:01:40,500 --> 00:01:45,445
The lap comes back to where it started. One shard, four more waiting.